  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Performance of Seven Women in BGD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Performance of Seven Women in BGD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On the occasion of the International Women&apos;s Day (March 8th), the     Embassy will organise a half day event which will include performance of a documentary play titled &apos;Seven&apos;, which is based on the real life stories of seven women&apos;s human rights activists from Nigeria,         Afghanistan, Guatemala, Russia, Pakistan, Northern Ireland and        Cambodia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

F&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja debatten om kvinnors m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter  Bangladesh avser den svenska ambassaden i Dhaka att i samband med den internationella kvinnodagen, genomf&#xf6;ra en dokument&#xe4;r pj&#xe4;s. Pj&#xe4;sen, Seven, bygger p&#xe5; intervjuer med sju kvinnliga m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsaktivister fr&#xe5;n olika delar av v&#xe4;rlden. Pj&#xe4;sen g&#xf6;rs i form av en uppl&#xe4;sning d&#xe4;r sju, oftast framst&#xe5;ende beslutsfattare, aktivister etc, l&#xe5;nar sina r&#xf6;ster &#xe5;t de sju ber&#xe4;ttelserna. Arrangemanget genomf&#xf6;rs i samarbete med norska, danska och brasilianska ambassaderna, kanadensiska high commission samt UN Women och UNFPA.</narrative>
  </description>
